- `cp`
- `mv`
- `rm`
- `rmdir`
- `file`
- `cat`
- `less`
- `more`
- `ln`

### Crucial flags

- `mkdir -p` — create parent directories as required.
- `cp -r` — recursively copy directories.
- `cp -a` — archive-style copy, preserving attributes where supported.
- `mv -i` — prompt before overwriting.
- `rm -i` — prompt before deleting.
